SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:storytime,library,baby,toddler,reading
DESCRIPTION:Organizer: Chicago Public Library\\nCost: free\\nAges: 0-60 mo
 nths\\nCategory: Storytime\\n\\nInterested in learning more about how to u
 se the computer or need a refresher? We are now offering one-on-one basic 
 computer skills development through the online resource Chicago Digital Le
 arn. If you prefer to use your own laptop\, feel free to bring it. Book a 
 1-on-1 appointment\, or just drop by the desk on the 2nd floor with any te
 ch-related questions. For computer assistance\, please call or stop by the
  branch. Accessibility Need sign language interpretation or other accessib
 ility assistance \\n\\nMore info: https://chipublib.bibliocommons.com/even
 ts/6971383a2c65973d001924aa
LOCATION:Chicago Bee\, 3647 S. State St.\, Chicago\, IL 60609
URL:https://chipublib.bibliocommons.com/events/6971383a2c65973d001924aa
