DESCRIPTION:Organizer: Chicago Children's Museum - Program Calendar\\nCost
 : paid admission (free first Sunday for Chicago residents)\\nAges: 0-60 mo
 nths\\nCategory: Play & Games\\n\\nPack your imagination and get ready for
  adventure! Going Places invites children and caregivers to explore moveme
 nt\, direction\, and journeys through playful experiences that encourage c
 uriosity\, creativity\, and discovery. Whether traveling across a room or 
 to an imaginary destination\, every adventure builds confidence\, sparks s
 torytelling\, and inspires new ways to play together.\\n\\nMore info: http
 s://www.chicagochildrensmuseum.org/program-calendar
LOCATION:Chicago Children's Museum\, 700 E Grand Ave\, Chicago\, IL 60611
URL:https://www.chicagochildrensmuseum.org/program-calendar
